72 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 25 0 R
/E (It is a great delight and prestige to extend a warm invitation to all prominent researchers. academicians, scientists and students to the symposium. This symposium will provide an international forum for scientific interchange across multiple disciplines focusing on mitochondria, cell death, and cancer in relation to human disease. Major themes encompass mitochondrial unfolded protein response, mitochondrial dynamics, mitochondrial respiration and metabolism, cell death pathways, and cancer therapeutics. The meeting will also foster international collaborations and scientific discussions among students, junior investigators, established leaders across many disciplines through specific sessions, panel discussions, oral and poster presentations. Researchers working in the areas of cell death and mitochondrial biology, and cancer biology as well as pathobiology of various human diseases are encouraged to attend the symposium.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [45]
>>
endobj
